Z||000013||FieroJoe||12-05-2001||11:01 AM||||I g-tech'd my coupe at 82HP at the wheels.  I have K&N, 8mm wires, AC Delco rapidfires, and the accel coils.  The accel coils are crap.  They don't do anything, and were a waste of money.  Every once and a while they will misfire at high RPMs.  Not a lot of Accel stuff is quality, I have heard.<P>But, the next mod Im doing to gain more rear wheel horspower is swapping in a V6!  Much better engine.<P>Anyways, my engines about going to fall apart too, 225,000 miles.||||reg||1
